## Change 1: Fix Empty Text Bug in Specialist Agents

### 1A — Early guard in `parse_specialist_output` (`app/agents/_helpers.py`)

**Location:** Lines 117–127. Insert before the `try:` block, after the `logger.debug(...)` call.

