# Efficacy Improvements 001 — Implementation Plan

## Context

The system works end-to-end. This plan addresses six targeted quality improvements:
1. Fix occasional empty-text crash in specialist agents (ratings_analyst)
2. Proactive graph generation for quantitative analysis
3. Use markdown tables for time-series data in synthesis output
4. Enforce a consistent output structure (Key Insights first)
5. Show tool calls, code snippets, and calculation outputs in the Reasoning tab
6. Display total thinking time in the main chat

---

## Critical Files

| File | Changes |
|------|---------|
| `app/agents/_helpers.py` | Change 1A |
| `app/agents/orchestrator.py` | Changes 1B, 5a–5d, 6a |
| `app/prompts/financial_analyst.md` | Change 2 |
